        "value": "えた おうきょらい（読み未詳）　にひゃくななじゅうよにん"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Outcaste (eta) residents entered under Obi's own five-character heading 穢多鷗居來: 274 persons. The third character is 鷗, the kyūjitai of 鴎 — its left half is 區 (a 匚 enclosure closed top and bottom with 品 inside), not 氏. The identical heading appears on the facing leaf upper p.76 left, where the count is 61 households. The compound is a domain-specific status label, not a standard Hansei Ichiran field name, and its reading is not established."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "穢多鴟居來人口 (飫肥藩分)"
